    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending it Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless emergency staircase.<br>You don\u2019t know how you got here, and there\u2019s no clear exit in sight.<br>One thing is certain\u2014you must <strong>climb up to escape</strong>.<br>The way out is on the <strong>20th floor</strong>, but the path won\u2019t be simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend, you will encounter two doors on each floor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice an anomaly, take the left door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there are no anomalies, take the right door.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With collapsing stairs and a space filled with clutter, can you overcome the tension and find your way out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Climb the stairs, make your choices, and find your way out. A new chapter with a unique theme begins every <strong>5 floors</strong>.<br>\u2714 <strong>Simple yet profound decision-making</strong> \u2013 Your observation and judgment are the keys to survival.<br>\u2714 <strong>Supports Korean &amp; English</strong> \u2013 A user-friendly interface for an immersive experience.<br>\u2714 <strong>20-60 minutes of playtime</strong> \u2013 A short yet intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the ever-looping staircase.<br>Can you <strong>make it all the way to the top?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending it Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless emergency staircase.<br>You don\u2019t know how you got here, and there\u2019s no clear exit in sight.<br>One thing is certain\u2014you must <strong>climb up to escape</strong>.<br>The way out is on the <strong>20th floor</strong>, but the path won\u2019t be simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend, you will encounter two doors on each floor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice an anomaly, take the left door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there are no anomalies, take the right door.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With collapsing stairs and a space filled with clutter, can you overcome the tension and find your way out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Climb the stairs, make your choices, and find your way out. A new chapter with a unique theme begins every <strong>5 floors</strong>.<br>\u2714 <strong>Simple yet profound decision-making</strong> \u2013 Your observation and judgment are the keys to survival.<br>\u2714 <strong>Supports Korean &amp; English</strong> \u2013 A user-friendly interface for an immersive experience.<br>\u2714 <strong>20-60 minutes of playtime</strong> \u2013 A short yet intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the ever-looping staircase.<br>Can you <strong>make it all the way to the top?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Ending it Today is a psychological horror jump map simulator. Climb 20 floors through collapsed staircases and eerie anomalies. If you see something strange, take the left door. If not, go right. Every five floors bring new themes, heightening the tension.",
